          "expected": "成员只能查看本人身份且不能调用管理员账号管理；停用账号不能登录，UI 显示对应错误",
          "data_program": "tests/server/fixtures.py",
          "dataset": "auth_accounts",
          "sop": "sop/SOP-014-e2e.md",
          "automated_test": "apps/macos/TokenMeterUITests/TM001AccountUITests.swift",
          "acceptance_id": "AC-TM001-002",
          "native_test": "TokenMeterUITests/TM001AccountUITests/testE2E_TM001_002"
        },
        {
          "id": "E2E-TM001-003",
          "scenario": "管理员重置密码并撤销已有会话",
          "expected": "新密码生效、旧会话失效，管理动作产生审计记录",
          "data_program": "tests/server/fixtures.py",
          "dataset": "auth_accounts",
          "sop": "sop/SOP-014-e2e.md",
          "automated_test": "apps/macos/TokenMeterUITests/TM001AccountUITests.swift",
          "acceptance_id": "AC-TM001-003",
          "native_test": "TokenMeterUITests/TM001AccountUITests/testE2E_TM001_003"
        },
        {
          "id": "E2E-TM001-005",
          "scenario": "生产 SQLite 首建管理员：隔离生产库副本中仅有 admin，真实 App 以初始密码登录、强制改密并验证管理界面；测试账号未进入该库",
          "expected": "生产 SQLite 首次建库只预置 admin / 123456，真实 App 登录后强制改密；测试账号不进入生产库，后续启动不重置已改密码",
          "data_program": "scripts/bootstrap_sqlite.py",
          "dataset": "production_bootstrap",
          "sop": "sop/SOP-014-e2e.md",
          "automated_test": "apps/macos/TokenMeterUITests/TM001AccountUITests.swift",
          "acceptance_id": "AC-TM001-005",
          "native_test": "TokenMeterUITests/TM001AccountUITests/testE2E_TM001_005"
        },
        {
          "id": "E2E-TM001-004",
          "scenario": "最小更新器：首次候选干净安装后经 HTTPS 获取受控高版本签名测试包并点击更新；后续版本从上一稳定版升级，另尝试无效签名包",
          "expected": "最小更新器随首个产品版本交付；有效包替换与重启成功且保留账号状态，无效签名被拒绝并保留原版",
          "data_program": "tests/e2e/update_source.py",
          "dataset": "tm001_update_packages",
          "sop": "sop/SOP-014-e2e.md",
          "automated_test": "apps/macos/TokenMeterUITests/TM001AccountUITests.swift",
          "acceptance_id": "AC-TM001-004",
          "native_test": "TokenMeterUITests/TM001AccountUITests/testE2E_TM001_004"
        }
      ],
      "source_requirement": "REQ-TM001",
      "depends_on": []
